<p>We fixed a behavior where an active effect applied to a stat (such as +2 BODY from Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace) would continue to increase/decrease whenever the reputation or 
Eurobucks changed on the character. This should no longer happen, but if you see the stat keep reverting to the wrong value after changing it in the sheet, follow 
these steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>Disable the Active Effect in the Effects tab</li>
<li>Edit the stat to the correct value</li>
<li>Enable the Active Effect again</li>
</ol>
<p>This should resolve the issue for good on your character.</p>

<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fix HTML Stripping in item descriptions on character sheets</li>
<li>Fix Create/Edit Role Ability dialog not submitting.</li>
<li>#583 - Using ledger re-applies all Active Effects.</li>
</ul>
